|YKOGuilds are disciplines, organizations, faiths, and traditions your
character learns. Classes describe what a character innately is. They are
separate choices; use |YKBhelp guilds|YKO and |YKBhelp classes|YKO for the
current rosters.

Joining requirements, directions, advancement, equipment rules, and
playstyles vary. Many guilds begin around level 5, but that is not a universal
rule. Read the guild page, ask current members, and review
|YKBhelp archetypes|YKO, |YKBhelp roles|YKO, and |YKBhelp combos|YKO before
committing.

